      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### 1a: Variable selection and sample restriction\n",
        "First, we remove observations before year 2000, then we select ten stock-level characteristics based on the variable-importance results in @Gu.2020, especially Figure 5. The selected variables cover price trends (`characteristic_mom1m`, `characteristic_mom12m`), size and liquidity (`characteristic_mvel1`, `characteristic_turn`), risk and volatility (`characteristic_beta`, `characteristic_retvol`), and valuation/fundamentals (`characteristic_bm`, `characteristic_ep`, `characteristic_roaq`, `characteristic_invest`).\n",
        "\n",
        "For the macroeconomic state variables, we follow @Gu.2020 Table 4 and include aggregate book-to-market (`macro_bm`), the Treasury bill rate (`macro_tbl`), the default yield spread (`macro_dfy`), and the term spread (`macro_tms`). These variables capture aggregate valuation, interest rate conditions, credit risk, and the slope of the yield curve."
      ],
      "id": "308a629f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "cache": false
      },
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#df = pd.read_parquet(\"/Users/AstridMoeller/Documents/GitHub/AEF-git/data-python/stock_characteristics_monthly.parquet\")\n",
        "\n",
        "df = pd.read_parquet(\"/Users/AstridMoeller/AEF/data/stock_characteristics_monthly.parquet\")\n",
        "df.head()\n",
        "\n",
        "# keep observations from January 2000 onward\n",
        "df[\"date\"] = pd.to_datetime(df[\"date\"])\n",
        "df = df.loc[df[\"date\"] >= \"2000-01-01\"].copy()"
      ],
      "id": "d772274a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "stock_chars = [\n",
        "    \"characteristic_mom1m\",    # short-term reversal (price trend)\n",
        "    \"characteristic_mom12m\",   # 12-month momentum (price trend)\n",
        "    \"characteristic_mvel1\",    # size (liquidity)\n",
        "    \"characteristic_turn\",     # share turnover (liquidity)\n",
        "    \"characteristic_beta\",     # market beta (risk)\n",
        "    \"characteristic_retvol\",   # return volatility (risk)\n",
        "    \"characteristic_bm\",       # book-to-market (value)\n",
        "    \"characteristic_ep\",       # earnings-to-price (value)\n",
        "    \"characteristic_roaq\",     # profitability\n",
        "    \"characteristic_invest\",   # investment growth\n",
        "]\n",
