    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Overall, the sample remains large after cleaning and is suitable for machine learning. The missing-value treatment balances data retention with robustness, while the industry recoding keeps the dimensionality of the feature matrix manageable.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1c: Feature matrix construction\n",
        "We construct the feature matrix using the selected stock characteristics and their interactions with macroeconomic state variables. The interaction terms allow the predictive effect of firm characteristics to vary with aggregate conditions, consistent with the setup in @Gu.2020. With 10 stock characteristics and 4 macro variables, this gives 10 stock-level predictors and 40 interaction terms, or 50 continuous features in total. We also include industry dummies based on the recoded SIC divisions."
      ],
      "id": "02bad157"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Create stock characteristic × macro interactions\n",
        "interaction_cols = []\n",
        "for s in stock_chars:\n",
        "    for m in macro_vars:\n",
        "        name = f\"{s}_x_{m}\"\n",
        "        df[name] = df[s] * df[m]\n",
        "        interaction_cols.append(name)\n",
        "\n",
        "# One-hot encode broad industry groups\n",
        "sic_dummies = pd.get_dummies(df[\"sic_division\"], prefix=\"sic\", drop_first=True, dtype=int)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Final feature sets\n",
        "continuous_features = stock_chars + interaction_cols\n",
        "dummy_features = list(sic_dummies.columns)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Build X, y, and metadata objects for later exercises\n",
        "X = pd.concat(\n",
        "    [df[continuous_features].reset_index(drop=True),\n",
        "     sic_dummies.reset_index(drop=True)],\n",
        "    axis=1\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "y = df[\"ret_excess\"].reset_index(drop=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "meta = df[[\"permno\", \"date\", \"mktcap_lag\", \"ret_excess\"]].reset_index(drop=True)"
      ],
      "id": "1ee696ed",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "feature_overview = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "    \"object\": [\"X\", \"y\", \"meta\"],\n",
        "    \"shape\": [X.shape, y.shape, meta.shape]\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "feature_overview"
      ],
      "id": "e43fc3f6",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "    \"feature_group\": [\"stock characteristics\", \"interaction terms\", \"industry dummies\", \"total features\"],\n",
        "    \"count\": [len(stock_chars), len(interaction_cols), len(dummy_features), X.shape[1]]\n",
        "})"
      ],
